 rich storyline. You play as a cat exploring the town, interacting with the residents, and searching for clues to uncover a heartwarming story that's been hidden for years.\nSpecial Thanks To:\n- The amazing performances of over 10 town residents.\n- Sheriff Stan for his unwavering support and assistance.\n- The anonymous donations of mission items from several townspeople.\n- Dozens of town-approved achievements waiting for you to unlock\u2026\nWe hope you enjoy a magical and touching adventure in the town. Have fun!", "short_description": "Cat in Town is a sandbox action-adventure game, you play as a cat who mysteriously finds itself living in a coastal town, full of vibrant stories just waiting for you to explore and experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy.737.com/protocol/30379-2.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FEIYU TECHNOLOGY HONGKONG LIMITED ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holo-goose.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25212431618438018"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828793_697142473301571_4648483731361869931_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_m